{ block_string.init - a DSEE derived object of be_com/backend.ins.pas
  (cc.a88k only): the names of the basic block kinds (block$t), 4 of 6 characters;
  dmp_$basic_block_header prints a block's kind and path_to with them.
  Included by dmp.pas after its other inserts.

  No Apollo copy survives; reconstructed from the DOMAIN C 6.9 binary
  cc.a88k: dmp's data +0x2E8 (24 bytes, set by .rwdi).

  Not known from the original: the declaration's form (its name is the
  file's). }

var
  block_string: array [block$t] of packed array [1..6] of char := [
    'normal',
    'start ',
    'final ',
    'return'];
